[{"title":"示顿修侍者","author":"释函是","text":"让公曾亦侍卢能，十五年来面目仍。\n足下马驹天下踏，果然今古竞头称。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示广慈侍者","author":"释函是","text":"一见桃花更不疑，数枝红绽自相宜。\n招携直入千峰里，溪月山云似旧时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示崔石师","author":"释函是","text":"念念须自见其心，莫教随世枉升沉。\n勋名盖代一场梦，惟有此心无古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雷峰华严长期","author":"释函是","text":"宝镜重重帝网新，交参主伴有来因。\n隆兴拄杖炽然说，为寄华严会上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙峰禅人住静潭山乞诗示此","author":"释函是","text":"一茅缚就放身眠，万事从他在目前。\n须信隔垣人有耳，莫教长啸白云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶述","author":"释函是","text":"四十年来又一年，举头平望尽霜天。\n策杖自来还自往，不须人伴过前川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙静主呈船子颂却示","author":"释函是","text":"沧茫巨浸浪滔滔，只怕无风自著篙。\n多少弄潮人在岸，等閒馀韵落波涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示知量道人","author":"释函是","text":"大道绝无男女相，亦无初学与先知。\n虽然七十未为老，岁岁当如初学时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送證侍者","author":"释函是","text":"送子匡山为卜居，悬崖飞瀑梦魂随。\n莫贪笋蕨迟春信，忘却雷峰斫额时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题燕杏图","author":"释函是","text":"燕子春归花正开，一团红雪锁青苔。\n披图忽动河山恨，何况亲从北地来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹鹤图","author":"释函是","text":"不下青松下翠竹，孤云野鹤尽相宜。\n最怜寒夜一声唳，梦断疏烟微月时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛卯夏日大雨戏示诸衲","author":"释函是","text":"一回风雨便淋漓，数十残僧面面窥。\n大地江山同逆旅，不妨权且作船居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"释函是","text":"落日潮平半掩扉，田高山浅鹧鸪肥。\n野人策杖欲何去，遥见溪桥数衲归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼望诸衲二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"青山一半枕楼头，门对长江水自流。\n烟树望中添数衲，恐惊鸿雁下沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼望诸衲二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"万山晴色沁秋寒，去住浮云任我看。\n不尽登临今古意，何人林外夕阳残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雷峰雨后","author":"释函是","text":"秋林濯濯野烟浮，万古江山色共幽。\n且对暮云閒不散，不知世上有人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸巳七月二十二日口占","author":"释函是","text":"瘴海栖迟十二秋，避兵长傍蓼花洲。\n无端一夜西风急，又报笳声到市头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江帆","author":"释函是","text":"一帆如鹜趁秋风，万顷烟波历乱中。\n莫向青山誇旧隐，松风江月两无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日与诸子晚眺","author":"释函是","text":"夕阳斜映菊花开，一上峰头万木哀。\n与子更穷千里目，百年能得几登台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望罗浮","author":"释函是","text":"野人去住似孤云，望里罗浮忽忽亲。\n曾忆数年寒夜月，听猿别是一閒身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送秋","author":"释函是","text":"风急烟销远岫开，长空只有雁归来。\n青山久住忘人世，时爱松阴破绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画雁四首 其一 春","author":"释函是","text":"濛濛烟雨醉春光，桃李花开归计忙。\n芦苇岂分南北岸，旧时遗泽未应忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画雁四首 其二 夏","author":"释函是","text":"不为江南乏稻粱，乾坤有恨北天长。\n征穷沙漠雪销尽，稳坐烟波六月霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画雁四首 其三 秋","author":"释函是","text":"朔风初动便图南，声断衡阳秋水涵。\n亦知瘴热非长乐，浅浦荒原尚一堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画雁四首 其四 冬","author":"释函是","text":"晴波风急月微微，半隐平沙半欲飞。\n不是畏寒安海国，得成毛羽趁春归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊虔州","author":"释函是","text":"一帆风送到虔州，城枕长江水北流。\n十年人物今何在，月色笳声满渡头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋无月二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"去年此夕海云开，此夕今年山雾来。\n若使月明照潭水，恐惊飞雁一徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋无月二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"清光不欲动人怀，黯澹秋山只自谐。\n却忆榕桥寒月后，几人形影在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自饶州还匡山","author":"释函是","text":"夜泊城头秋气微，湖烟江月共依依。\n世间安有閒云鹤，不向匡庐何处归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初冬游玉渊潭","author":"释函是","text":"石上看云昨日同，莫将浓澹想秋空。\n叶红霜白溪流缓，拚却山容与朔风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆足两","author":"释函是","text":"半年音信望来孤，渐到秋深景自殊。\n白鹭洲前明月近，不知犹忆老僧无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆阿字","author":"释函是","text":"长安东去一身孤，两度逢秋心事殊。\n极塞月圆寒已栗，不知曾入玉关无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼崔石师四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"独坐山房意黯然，濛濛秋雨瘴南天。\n海门浪涌分淇水，水上人家空可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼崔石师四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"远别沉吟古墓边，伤心曾忆五年前。\n何人重觅鸾溪上，才问崔郎已渺然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼崔石师四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"身心久已拚空门，在欲行禅未易言。\n惭愧老僧辜负汝，绿萝庵里待招魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼崔石师四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"珍重峰头谒老翁，当年谁共听朝钟。\n死生如对秋山雨，悲喜何曾入画中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"释函是","text":"世上閒人岂易得，不妨无事上山行。\n松风落落溪云外，难得秋原一望晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"释函是","text":"折花相赠为多情，千里持来意不轻。\n谁知更有多情者，抛却花枝两泪倾